      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 104,
          "verse": 3
        }
      ],
      "en": "He lays the beams of his rooms in the waters. He makes the clouds his chariot. He walks on the wings of the wind.",
      "ko": "물에 자기 누각의 들보를 얹으시며 구름으로 자기 수레를 삼으시고 바람 날개로 다니시며",
      "source_text_hash": "db2006bc1d3399a32f9b4831d03ebd4956e0e25ab606e94993beb7efebd7930e",
      "translation_text_hash": "7dd6a1f9db318a33910af1fa02f120e9be906f62d03eaa2a7123cc52c97e1bda",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
