      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 104,
          "verse": 6
        }
      ],
      "en": "You covered it with the deep as with a cloak. The waters stood above the mountains.",
      "ko": "옷으로 덮음 같이 땅을 바다로 덮으시매 물이 산들 위에 섰더니",
      "source_text_hash": "97cab2799dd44ac9300aae562e2f6b9103b6eeaf3b6f7b068566bedb648c7f4f",
      "translation_text_hash": "46c4f8853ee4c317ae011094b9d027d8b741dfae6af1ac7e63aa5705448cc35c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "옷으로 덮음 같이 땅을 바다로 덮으시매 물이 산들 위에 섰더니"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "46c4f8853ee4c317ae011094b9d027d8b741dfae6af1ac7e63aa5705448cc35c"
      ]
    },
    {
